#, csharp-format
msgid "slotRemap.warning.ambiguousDetail"
msgstr ""
"「{0}」中 {1} 的材質插槽對應關係不明確：轉換後插槽 [{2}]，參照插槽 [{3}]，"
"推測對應（轉換後 -> 參照）[{4}]"

#, csharp-format
msgid "slotRemap.warning.ambiguous"
